WEBVTT

00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:26.614
A ship laden with sorrows

00:00:28.594 --> 00:00:38.794
Loudly singing its song of ruin

00:00:43.604 --> 00:00:48.134
From the blackest depths

00:00:49.574 --> 00:00:54.674
It rises to the surface

00:00:58.654 --> 00:01:09.794
Oh! You and I! We stretch our white wings now!

00:01:10.604 --> 00:01:21.544
Flying off into the vast sky

00:01:21.544 --> 00:01:35.724
We dream of that day, dream of that day

00:02:03.084 --> 00:02:04.574
What's wrong?

00:02:06.324 --> 00:02:08.154
Are you lost?

00:02:11.294 --> 00:02:12.424
What is it?

00:02:13.124 --> 00:02:14.824
Hey, now!

00:02:15.364 --> 00:02:17.664
Cut that out!

00:02:19.504 --> 00:02:22.024
The parent-child bond.

00:02:24.504 --> 00:02:30.914
I've always said that dorm
was full of troublemakers!

00:02:31.584 --> 00:02:34.644
This sets a poor example for the other students!

00:02:34.814 --> 00:02:38.774
Stringent disciplinary standards
must be enforced!

00:02:39.984 --> 00:02:41.394
Are you listening, Headmaster?

00:02:41.394 --> 00:02:42.914
Yes...

00:02:53.204 --> 00:02:54.634
And?

00:02:56.974 --> 00:03:02.004
In particular with regards to the
ringleader of this recent disturbance...

00:03:02.144 --> 00:03:04.844
I'd appreciate it if you'd admonish
her yourself, Headmaster!

00:03:04.844 --> 00:03:06.284
Yes, I'll have a good talk with her.

00:03:06.284 --> 00:03:08.784
Student Information
6/20/1999
Akane Kawashima
Born May 27, 1981 - age 17
Kenichi Tomonaga - step-father - 8/17/61
Mariko Tomonaga - mother - 9/4/57
Yes, I'll have a good talk with her.

00:03:09.054 --> 00:03:10.954
Please do.

00:03:11.124 --> 00:03:12.744
Good day, sir.

00:03:22.094 --> 00:03:24.994
So, you're space aliens?

00:03:25.304 --> 00:03:30.274
We're from another phase
of the m-brane multiverse,

00:03:30.274 --> 00:03:32.544
so "space aliens" isn't really the right term.

00:03:32.544 --> 00:03:36.474
Commander, it's no use trying to
explain to this primitive Forime!

00:03:36.984 --> 00:03:39.014
Who're you calling primitive?

00:03:39.014 --> 00:03:41.614
I'm just telling it like it is!

00:03:41.614 --> 00:03:45.854
Oh yeah? Well, at least I don't go
wafting around like a creepy ghost!

00:03:48.924 --> 00:03:52.384
In any case, you're not from Earth, are you?

00:03:56.564 --> 00:03:58.654
I'm sorry.

00:04:03.434 --> 00:04:04.834
Ekaril speaking.

00:04:05.174 --> 00:04:06.904
Pardon the intrusion.

00:04:07.174 --> 00:04:12.974
Actually, our ship lost track of
a probe in your area yesterday.

00:04:13.184 --> 00:04:17.144
Not that the loss of a mere probe concerns me...

00:04:17.524 --> 00:04:21.384
But I thought it best to notify you, Commander.

00:04:21.724 --> 00:04:25.314
Thank you, Commander Shivariel.

00:04:25.564 --> 00:04:28.864
But why was your probe in this
sector to begin with?

00:04:29.194 --> 00:04:35.434
Why, indeed? I suppose it's autonomic sensors
malfunctioned and it wandered off course.

00:04:35.674 --> 00:04:40.234
Then perhaps it's down at the
bottom of the ocean somewhere.

00:04:41.014 --> 00:04:42.534
Perhaps so.

00:04:43.244 --> 00:04:48.804
In any case, until the main invading battalion
arrives, we should exercise vigilance...

00:04:49.784 --> 00:04:51.014
For everyone's sake.

00:04:51.884 --> 00:04:53.874
I appreciate the advice.

00:04:54.294 --> 00:04:57.194
Is there been any further word from Arume?

00:04:57.564 --> 00:05:00.554
She really is an alien!

00:05:01.194 --> 00:05:02.894
Our original mission

00:05:02.894 --> 00:05:06.064
was to perform a comprehensive
survey of this planet.

00:05:07.674 --> 00:05:12.734
But as soon as we arrived,
there was a terrible accident.

00:05:13.574 --> 00:05:15.704
It was beyond anyone's control,

00:05:17.514 --> 00:05:21.044
but the Commander feels
personally responsible.

00:05:22.254 --> 00:05:25.124
I keep urging her to resume
our investigation, but...

00:05:25.124 --> 00:05:26.954
Roger. Over and out.
I keep urging her to resume
our investigation, but...

00:05:29.024 --> 00:05:31.014
Pardon the interruption.

00:05:32.894 --> 00:05:34.364
I-I don't care!

00:05:35.264 --> 00:05:37.824
Hagino! Got a minute?

00:05:38.234 --> 00:05:41.764
Have you guys got any plans for summer break?

00:05:42.134 --> 00:05:44.574
I was wondering if you'd all
like to come home with...

00:05:45.374 --> 00:05:48.104
Hmm? What's wrong, Wakatake?

00:05:49.644 --> 00:05:52.134
Er, n-nothing!

00:05:53.114 --> 00:05:55.244
Get me Kelbil's location.

00:05:57.154 --> 00:06:01.454
Ship Two, Kelbil.
Currently voyaging in Trench Two.

00:06:02.694 --> 00:06:04.254
Hmm...

00:06:05.764 --> 00:06:07.924
Mobilize Ship Two.

00:06:08.134 --> 00:06:09.464
Roger.

00:06:09.464 --> 00:06:12.364
This is Novaal. Come in, Kelbil.

00:06:12.804 --> 00:06:16.394
Ship Two, Kelbil, is ordered
to mobilize immediately!

00:06:16.734 --> 00:06:22.174
Proceed to Trench Five, locate
and destroy Ship Five!

00:06:33.484 --> 00:06:37.784
Akane Kawashima of the 11th Grade
Cherry Blossom class. Excuse me.

00:06:40.064 --> 00:06:41.554
Yo.

00:06:42.864 --> 00:06:43.594
Chemistry Lab

00:06:43.594 --> 00:06:46.694
Chemistry Lab
Impossible! I can't! I really can't do it!

00:06:47.034 --> 00:06:49.024
Now, let's talk about this...

00:06:49.174 --> 00:06:50.344
Miss Kozuki!

00:06:50.344 --> 00:06:51.504
Excuse me!

00:06:51.504 --> 00:06:53.404
Now, wait!

00:06:54.244 --> 00:06:56.104
I guess that's a no.

00:06:59.744 --> 00:07:01.414
Teacher Yuko?

00:07:01.414 --> 00:07:07.724
Yes. She asked me to write a play
for the school festival.

00:07:08.254 --> 00:07:12.364
But I don't know anything about theater.

00:07:12.364 --> 00:07:16.384
Besides, I've never shown my
writing to anyone! I couldn't!

00:07:16.694 --> 00:07:21.764
I said no, but I don't think
she's going to let it go.

00:07:24.104 --> 00:07:25.174
You should do it!

00:07:25.174 --> 00:07:26.304
Huh?

00:07:26.304 --> 00:07:32.834
You really should! It'll be more fun to have
everyone appreciate your work, Michi!

00:07:33.384 --> 00:07:35.414
But I...

00:07:35.414 --> 00:07:39.374
You really care about your stories, right?

00:07:40.254 --> 00:07:45.594
I think it's better for your stories if
you let everyone enjoy them!

00:07:45.994 --> 00:07:48.554
Better... for my stories?

00:07:48.694 --> 00:07:51.364
Yes... I'm sure of it!

00:07:51.704 --> 00:07:54.194
You think so too, don't you?

00:07:56.504 --> 00:07:59.034
Er... Miss Senkoji?

00:07:59.344 --> 00:08:00.704
What's wrong?

00:08:02.214 --> 00:08:04.374
I don't really know.

00:08:18.764 --> 00:08:21.284
Why didn't you send me to destroy them?

00:08:21.564 --> 00:08:23.964
Calm yourself, Azanael!

00:08:24.304 --> 00:08:27.934
As yet, we have no concrete proof of treason.

00:08:27.934 --> 00:08:29.524
But...

00:08:31.374 --> 00:08:36.314
The main fleet will be here soon.
We mustn't be rash.

00:08:36.974 --> 00:08:40.414
But with Kelbil's abilities...

00:08:41.354 --> 00:08:44.114
Current hull pressure, 16000.

00:08:44.284 --> 00:08:47.124
Emil Force Drive to reach critical point in 30!

00:08:47.124 --> 00:08:49.254
Prepare for ship transport.

00:08:50.194 --> 00:08:52.124
Begin transport immediately!

00:08:52.124 --> 00:08:53.594
Engine reaching critical zone!

00:08:54.034 --> 00:08:55.994
Dimensional field established!

00:08:56.294 --> 00:08:57.964
Initiate transport!

00:09:05.104 --> 00:09:07.074
Kelbil's transport is complete.

00:09:09.114 --> 00:09:12.874
Now she knows we mean business.

00:09:14.584 --> 00:09:17.174
The rest is up to Ekaril.

00:09:21.394 --> 00:09:23.184
Excuse me.

00:09:24.024 --> 00:09:27.424
Headmaster, regarding the
matter we discussed...

00:09:28.434 --> 00:09:30.394
Headmaster!

00:09:30.664 --> 00:09:32.634
Are you all right, Headmaster?

00:09:32.734 --> 00:09:35.034
Speak to me, Headmaster!

00:09:35.204 --> 00:09:37.364
Somebody! Call an ambulance!

00:10:01.634 --> 00:10:04.464
Hey! Did you hear about
the Headmaster collapsing?

00:10:04.464 --> 00:10:08.534
Yeah! They took him away in an ambulance!
He's in the hospital!

00:10:08.534 --> 00:10:09.704
I hope he's okay!

00:10:09.704 --> 00:10:11.404
Yeah, what a shocker!

00:10:28.524 --> 00:10:30.524
W-what? What was that?

00:10:30.524 --> 00:10:34.014
Attack by a high-energy
physical warhead detected.

00:10:34.394 --> 00:10:36.534
Point of contact: Left wing area.

00:10:36.534 --> 00:10:39.624
Flooding in blocks 23 through 41.

00:10:39.864 --> 00:10:41.704
All units mobilizing for battle.

00:10:41.704 --> 00:10:43.504
A physical warhead?

00:10:43.504 --> 00:10:45.704
You didn't detect it until it hit?

00:10:45.704 --> 00:10:47.434
It was undetectable.

00:10:51.584 --> 00:10:53.914
Our first shot has hit the target.

00:10:53.914 --> 00:10:56.114
Initiating charge of second shot.

00:10:56.954 --> 00:10:58.584
Piece of cake!

00:10:58.754 --> 00:11:00.584
Activating chamber arm!

00:11:01.024 --> 00:11:02.924
Generating spear shell!

00:11:08.564 --> 00:11:11.084
Spear shell armoring complete!

00:11:12.734 --> 00:11:16.064
Targeting complete. Release cannon lock!

00:11:16.974 --> 00:11:18.304
Releasing cannon lock!

00:11:21.014 --> 00:11:22.444
Fire!

00:11:43.864 --> 00:11:45.264
Kelbil?!

00:11:45.664 --> 00:11:53.094
It was a complete surprise. Our defenses were
down, and the ship has been damaged.

00:11:53.674 --> 00:11:56.074
We've managed to shake them for now...

00:11:56.074 --> 00:12:00.074
But if they attack again,
the damage could be critical.

00:12:00.814 --> 00:12:04.914
Understood. If they do...

00:12:05.554 --> 00:12:07.644
I'll personally take command.

00:12:07.994 --> 00:12:11.944
But commander! It's an ally ship!

00:12:12.524 --> 00:12:14.924
If we engage them in battle...

00:12:17.864 --> 00:12:20.734
I'm sorry I got you involved in this, Tsubael.

00:12:21.374 --> 00:12:23.734
No, Commander...

00:12:24.444 --> 00:12:26.844
I'll await your report.

00:12:38.554 --> 00:12:40.484
Listen well, ladies!

00:12:41.094 --> 00:12:44.264
The Headmaster has collapsed from stress

00:12:44.264 --> 00:12:47.554
due to the misbehavior of certain
members of the student body!

00:12:47.894 --> 00:12:51.764
I expect renewed adherence to discipline,

00:12:51.764 --> 00:12:56.834
including strict observance of
curfew and lights-out!

00:12:56.834 --> 00:13:00.604
Violations will subject to severe punishments!

00:13:01.544 --> 00:13:03.204
Do I make myself clear?

00:13:05.984 --> 00:13:09.884
They're going to transfer him to the university
hospital for more testing soon.

00:13:10.584 --> 00:13:13.614
You should go see him right away!

00:13:14.224 --> 00:13:17.314
Who, me? Don't be ridiculous.

00:13:17.694 --> 00:13:24.224
Rebel all you like. But this is no
time to hide your true feelings!

00:13:26.234 --> 00:13:27.704
After all...

00:13:28.134 --> 00:13:30.234
He's your father, isn't he?

00:13:31.374 --> 00:13:33.304
Thanks for reminding me.

00:13:33.604 --> 00:13:37.134
Is that really how you want to be?

00:13:40.184 --> 00:13:41.584
Have it your way!

00:13:51.724 --> 00:13:54.254
All right. I know you're there!

00:14:00.264 --> 00:14:03.604
They fired the ice spears from another phase?

00:14:05.144 --> 00:14:08.404
That is why they were
undetectable until detonation.

00:14:10.544 --> 00:14:12.104
I knew it!

00:14:12.684 --> 00:14:15.544
Then there's no point in trying to hide...

00:14:18.284 --> 00:14:19.254
Still nothing?

00:14:19.254 --> 00:14:23.154
I'm sorry, Commander.
They're traveling in Stealth Mode.

00:14:23.854 --> 00:14:25.794
The next shot will finish them.

00:14:26.464 --> 00:14:28.194
The headmaster?

00:14:28.294 --> 00:14:32.524
Yeah. You know, the classic divorce story.

00:14:32.734 --> 00:14:34.664
I didn't realize...

00:14:36.604 --> 00:14:42.974
I lived with my mom, but I just couldn't
warm up to my new dad.

00:14:43.814 --> 00:14:48.044
Old man Fukamachi wanted to do something,
so he had me enrolled here.

00:14:48.614 --> 00:14:52.344
It was the first time in ten years...

00:14:56.524 --> 00:14:58.424
That I saw him.

00:14:59.324 --> 00:15:03.024
He must have really missed you...

00:15:04.464 --> 00:15:10.804
He made some efforts to talk to me,
but I blew him off.

00:15:11.274 --> 00:15:16.674
Whatever the reasons, I went through a
lot of needless crap because of him.

00:15:18.014 --> 00:15:21.144
Whenever I get in trouble,
I get called into his office.

00:15:21.654 --> 00:15:29.954
But every time, we just end up drinking
coffee and reading the paper together.

00:15:31.394 --> 00:15:33.584
That was good enough for me.

00:15:34.564 --> 00:15:36.534
There's no call for me to visit his sick bed!

00:15:38.164 --> 00:15:42.264
Akane! You've got to go see him!

00:15:42.574 --> 00:15:44.094
You...

00:15:45.044 --> 00:15:48.804
You've got to face up to him
and work things out!

00:15:48.914 --> 00:15:53.284
Mari, this is a personal family matter...

00:15:53.384 --> 00:15:57.754
The Headmaster's waiting for you!
You know that, don't you, Akane?

00:15:57.754 --> 00:15:59.654
What makes it any of your business?

00:16:00.284 --> 00:16:04.024
Never mind the rest... he's your family, right?

00:16:04.494 --> 00:16:08.754
You want his support.
Let him give it to you... for his sake!

00:16:10.564 --> 00:16:12.534
Target detected!

00:16:13.634 --> 00:16:17.364
Energy response weak. The target is stationary.

00:16:18.174 --> 00:16:20.234
Let's finish this once and for all!

00:16:20.744 --> 00:16:23.444
Move into point blank range immediately!

00:16:23.444 --> 00:16:24.934
Roger!

00:16:35.694 --> 00:16:37.454
Hmm? What is it?

00:16:38.864 --> 00:16:39.994
Hey!

00:16:39.994 --> 00:16:41.654
Where...

00:16:53.604 --> 00:16:55.404
That's how it goes...

00:17:20.834 --> 00:17:21.964
Who's there?

00:17:28.944 --> 00:17:31.464
Where are you going at this hour?

00:17:31.784 --> 00:17:35.014
Oh, just out for a stroll...

00:17:36.254 --> 00:17:38.484
Akane was doing me a favor!

00:17:38.824 --> 00:17:43.724
I forgot something back at school,
and I asked her to get it!

00:17:43.924 --> 00:17:45.684
If it's about Ms. Kawashima,

00:17:46.524 --> 00:17:51.134
I ran out of binder paper,
and I asked her to buy me some!

00:17:51.134 --> 00:17:53.434
It's true! I...

00:17:54.374 --> 00:17:56.134
Oh! Mari!

00:17:56.734 --> 00:17:58.144
Michi!

00:17:58.144 --> 00:17:59.344
Akane!

00:17:59.344 --> 00:18:01.344
Where's that ice cream I asked you to...

00:18:01.344 --> 00:18:02.774
Oh!

00:18:07.244 --> 00:18:09.304
What on earth is going on?

00:18:09.584 --> 00:18:10.854
I had this ice cream craving...
I needed binder paper...
I forgot a book at school...

00:18:10.854 --> 00:18:12.374
That's enough!

00:18:12.854 --> 00:18:15.984
I'll take my punishment when I get back.

00:18:17.194 --> 00:18:18.424
But now...

00:18:18.624 --> 00:18:22.084
Sorry, but I've got to go.

00:18:23.764 --> 00:18:25.204
Ms. Kawashima?

00:18:25.204 --> 00:18:26.864
Yes! Yes! Yes!

00:18:29.734 --> 00:18:31.604
Sorry, Hagino.

00:18:32.074 --> 00:18:35.664
And thanks, everyone.

00:18:37.144 --> 00:18:38.904
Ms. Kawashima! Wait...

00:18:47.424 --> 00:18:48.914
Is that so?

00:18:49.454 --> 00:18:54.194
I understand now. But why did all of you...

00:18:54.434 --> 00:18:55.724
Don't you get it?

00:18:56.264 --> 00:19:00.634
Akane's trying to face her greatest demons!

00:19:00.704 --> 00:19:01.834
Don't you see?

00:19:01.834 --> 00:19:02.834
Mari...

00:19:02.834 --> 00:19:06.794
Don't you get why we want to support her?

00:19:07.814 --> 00:19:12.944
Don't you have anything you
care about more than anything?

00:19:13.384 --> 00:19:15.874
More than anything?

00:19:17.614 --> 00:19:19.644
That's enough, Mari.

00:19:20.784 --> 00:19:22.274
I apologize.

00:19:22.594 --> 00:19:23.924
Please forgive us.

00:19:24.924 --> 00:19:35.924
But you know... I was really glad she
decided to sneak out to see her dad.

00:19:36.804 --> 00:19:38.894
Anyway, let's get some sleep!

00:19:40.144 --> 00:19:43.704
We'll worry about the curfew later!

00:20:02.564 --> 00:20:03.864
Hey.

00:20:07.364 --> 00:20:08.994
Hey.

00:20:18.444 --> 00:20:21.084
Pay close attention to the surrounding waters.

00:20:21.084 --> 00:20:27.514
Any partial phase alteration could mean that
Kelbil's transporting to fire another missile.

00:20:27.824 --> 00:20:32.554
We've got to evade their first strike.
Then we'll leap on top of them.

00:20:33.624 --> 00:20:35.524
Spear shell solidified!

00:20:37.264 --> 00:20:38.734
Loading complete!

00:20:39.064 --> 00:20:42.764
The target is on the move.
They appear to be surfacing.

00:20:43.004 --> 00:20:45.874
It's all the same. Fire!

00:20:55.214 --> 00:20:56.214
Four...

00:20:56.214 --> 00:20:57.214
Three...

00:20:57.214 --> 00:20:58.224
Two...

00:20:58.224 --> 00:20:59.224
One...

00:20:59.224 --> 00:21:00.244
Zero.

00:21:02.124 --> 00:21:03.424
Target hit!

00:21:03.424 --> 00:21:07.054
No... Target performing Leminof Shift!

00:21:09.034 --> 00:21:10.634
The target has transported!

00:21:10.634 --> 00:21:11.754
Where are they?

00:21:11.964 --> 00:21:13.434
Right on top of us!

00:21:20.304 --> 00:21:21.674
The ship is damaged!

00:21:21.914 --> 00:21:24.644
The firing block's annihilated! We're in trouble!

00:21:24.644 --> 00:21:27.274
Retreat! Perform an emergency transport!

00:21:38.864 --> 00:21:42.024
Was that what you wanted?

00:21:42.934 --> 00:21:45.524
Yes. Well done.

00:21:46.164 --> 00:21:47.364
I appreciate it.

00:21:47.664 --> 00:21:51.164
No... that's not necessary.

00:21:51.804 --> 00:21:54.334
But Commander... now you're...

00:21:54.744 --> 00:21:57.304
Thank you. Have a rest now.

00:22:03.684 --> 00:22:06.214
What I care about more than anything...

00:22:24.574 --> 00:22:27.444
Hey, you! Hurry up, will you?

00:22:27.444 --> 00:22:29.344
You're going to make us late!

00:22:29.344 --> 00:22:33.874
Ooh, I can't believe Lady Hagino
is serving my soup!

00:22:34.514 --> 00:22:36.644
You guys? Why...

00:22:37.284 --> 00:22:39.484
Akane! Hurry up and help us out!

00:22:39.654 --> 00:22:41.644
This is our punishment for breaking curfew!

00:22:41.754 --> 00:22:45.924
With all of us together,
we got off with a week's kitchen duty!

00:22:46.124 --> 00:22:48.854
If you don't like that, no breakfast for you!

00:22:53.104 --> 00:22:55.034
All right! Just watch!

00:22:55.034 --> 00:22:59.904
Let's get a move on or it's going
to be dinner time! Hustle! Go!

00:23:02.374 --> 00:23:03.514
11th Grade Cherry Blossoms

00:23:03.514 --> 00:23:05.914
11th Grade Cherry Blossoms
Then it's settled! We'll present a play written by
Miss Michiko Kozuki at the school festival!

00:23:05.914 --> 00:23:10.514
School Festival Project
Then it's settled! We'll present a play written by
Miss Michiko Kozuki at the school festival!

00:23:10.814 --> 00:23:12.324
All in favor?

00:23:12.324 --> 00:23:14.344
Aye!

00:23:14.694 --> 00:23:16.594
This isn't happening...

00:23:29.004 --> 00:23:36.464
Standing side by side, hand in hand, by the sky

00:23:37.274 --> 00:23:47.324
Pledging our futures to the horizon

00:23:47.324 --> 00:23:54.994
A gentle breeze blowing

00:23:55.694 --> 00:24:03.574
As we melted into tomorrow

00:24:04.174 --> 00:24:07.774
The passing time

00:24:07.774 --> 00:24:13.114
Quietly watches over you

00:24:13.314 --> 00:24:17.054
Our sadness, our good-byes

00:24:17.054 --> 00:24:22.544
And our blue tears all make us stronger

00:24:23.894 --> 00:24:28.194
We sour after our dreams like budding flowers

00:24:28.194 --> 00:24:33.034
Searching for answers in life

00:24:33.034 --> 00:24:37.334
Always believing in the day

00:24:37.334 --> 00:24:43.044
We'll proudly unfurl our petals

00:24:43.044 --> 00:24:47.004
In the blue dreams!

00:25:01.194 --> 00:25:05.634
Mari is drawn to her beautiful teacher,
Yuko Sugawara,

00:25:06.404 --> 00:25:11.834
who is actually a secret investigator
sent to observe her.

00:25:13.374 --> 00:25:21.244
As fireworks adorn the night sky, Shivariel
unleashes a major air offensive.

00:25:22.814 --> 00:25:27.314
Next time on Blue Drop: Campanula.
